  "topk": 20,
  "seed": 1,
  "turns": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "speaker": "[S1]",
      "channel": 0,
      "text": "こんにちは、",
      "onset": 0.0,
      "duration": 1.04,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn000_S1.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "speaker": "[S2]",
      "channel": 1,
      "text": "こんにちは、いいお天気ですね。",
      "onset": 1.7424,
      "duration": 3.04,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn001_S2.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "speaker": "[S1]",
      "channel": 0,
      "text": "週末は何をしていましたか？",
      "onset": 4.6024,
      "duration": 2.32,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn002_S1.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "speaker": "[S2]",
      "channel": 1,
      "text": "えーと、子どもと一緒に公園に行ってきました。",
      "onset": 6.8224,
      "duration": 3.36,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn003_S2.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "speaker": "[S1]",
      "channel": 0,
      "text": "公園いいですね。",
      "onset": 10.0224,
      "duration": 1.68,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn004_S1.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "speaker": "[S2]",
      "channel": 1,
      "text": "そうなんです。でも、",
      "onset": 11.5624,
      "duration": 1.36,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn005_S2.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "speaker": "[S1]",
      "channel": 0,
      "text": "うん",
      "onset": 12.7224,
      "duration": 0.4,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn006_S1.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "speaker": "[S2]",
      "channel": 1,
      "text": "走り回るのがすごくて、かなり疲れました。",
      "onset": 13.0224,
      "duration": 3.28,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn007_S2.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "speaker": "[S1]",
      "channel": 0,
      "text": "アハハ、想像がつきます。",
      "onset": 16.4273,
      "duration": 2.56,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn008_S1.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "speaker": "[S2]",
      "channel": 1,
      "text": "親はただついていくのみですもんね。",
      "onset": 19.0895,
      "duration": 2.4,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn009_S2.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "speaker": "[S1]",
      "channel": 0,
      "text": "本当にそうだと思います。",
      "onset": 21.3495,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn010_S1.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "speaker": "[S2]",
      "channel": 1,
      "text": "その後は、家でゆっくり本を読んでいました。",
      "onset": 23.6873,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn011_S2.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "speaker": "[S1]",
      "channel": 0,
      "text": "おお、読書ですか。",
      "onset": 27.7673,
      "duration": 2.24,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn012_S1.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "speaker": "[S2]",
      "channel": 1,
      "text": "はい。最近は専門書を読み直していて。",
      "onset": 29.8273,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn013_S2.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "speaker": "[S1]",
      "channel": 0,
      "text": "勉強熱心ですね。",
      "onset": 33.7421,
      "duration": 1.6,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn014_S1.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "speaker": "[S2]",
      "channel": 1,
      "text": "うーん、今の仕事で必要なので。",
      "onset": 35.2221,
      "duration": 2.72,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn015_S2.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "speaker": "[S1]",
      "channel": 0,
      "text": "なるほど。お仕事に直結することなんですね。",
      "onset": 38.0221,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn016_S1.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "speaker": "[S2]",
      "channel": 1,
      "text": "ええ。製造業の方にいるので、",
      "onset": 42.3821,
      "duration": 2.88,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn017_S2.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "speaker": "[S1]",
      "channel": 0,
      "text": "うん",
      "onset": 45.0621,
      "duration": 0.4,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn018_S1.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "speaker": "[S2]",
      "channel": 1,
      "text": "技術的な更新が激しくて。",
      "onset": 45.2621,
      "duration": 2.4,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn019_S2.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "speaker": "[S1]",
      "channel": 0,
      "text": "技術職なんですね。",
      "onset": 48.1978,
      "duration": 1.6,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn020_S1.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "speaker": "[S2]",
      "channel": 1,
      "text": "はい。日々勉強しないと置いていかれる気がして。",
      "onset": 49.6978,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn021_S2.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "speaker": "[S1]",
      "channel": 0,
      "text": "その向上心、本当に尊敬します。",
      "onset": 53.1978,
      "duration": 2.96,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn022_S1.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "speaker": "[S2]",
      "channel": 1,
      "text": "ありがとうございます。ただ、",
      "onset": 56.2378,
      "duration": 1.92,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn023_S2.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "speaker": "[S1]",
      "channel": 0,
      "text": "うん",
      "onset": 57.9978,
      "duration": 0.32,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn024_S1.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "speaker": "[S2]",
      "channel": 1,
      "text": "自分の時間が全然足りないのが悩みで。",
      "onset": 58.1578,
      "duration": 3.12,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn025_S2.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "speaker": "[S1]",
      "channel": 0,
      "text": "ああ、分かります。",
      "onset": 61.9023,
      "duration": 1.84,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn026_S1.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "speaker": "[S2]",
      "channel": 1,
      "text": "仕事と家庭の両立って大変ですよね。",
      "onset": 63.8222,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn027_S2.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "speaker": "[S1]",
      "channel": 0,
      "text": "本当に。私もつい欲張って予定を詰め込みがちです。",
      "onset": 67.1623,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn028_S1.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "speaker": "[S2]",
      "channel": 1,
      "text": "そうですよね。あ、今の話、",
      "onset": 71.8822,
      "duration": 2.56,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn029_S2.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "speaker": "[S1]",
      "channel": 0,
      "text": "はい",
      "onset": 74.2422,
      "duration": 0.4,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn030_S1.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "speaker": "[S2]",
      "channel": 1,
      "text": "どういう意味でしたか？",
      "onset": 74.4423,
      "duration": 1.28,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn031_S2.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "speaker": "[S1]",
      "channel": 0,
      "text": "あ、すみません。私もやりたいことがたくさんあって、",
      "onset": 75.5422,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn032_S1.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "speaker": "[S2]",
      "channel": 1,
      "text": "うん",
      "onset": 79.2622,
      "duration": 0.4,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn033_S2.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "speaker": "[S1]",
      "channel": 0,
      "text": "つい無理にスケジュールを組んでしまうという意味です。",
      "onset": 79.5623,
      "duration": 3.12,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn034_S1.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "speaker": "[S2]",
      "channel": 1,
      "text": "あ、なるほど。そういうことですね。",
      "onset": 82.5623,
      "duration": 2.72,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn035_S2.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "speaker": "[S1]",
      "channel": 0,
      "text": "さっき、専門書を読み直していたって言ってましたよね。",
      "onset": 85.1423,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn036_S1.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "speaker": "[S2]",
      "channel": 1,
      "text": "はい、そうでした。",
      "onset": 89.6102,
      "duration": 1.04,
      "wav": "../audio/turns/turn037_S2.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "speaker": "[S1]",
      "channel": 0,
